JWT Authentication for Flask â€” Protected REST API Endpoint
==========================================================
Provides:
  - jwt_required   : decorator that validates a Bearer token on any route
  - /auth/token    : POST  â€” issues a signed JWT (login simulation)
  - /api/me        : GET   â€” protected; returns user data for the token holder
  - /api/admin     : GET   â€” protected; role-checked (admin only)

Dependencies:
    pip install flask pyjwt
